(BAS2-20: LANGUAGE.md:315 claims loop expansion works with "any action that
 takes an argument". It does not. `write <value> to <file>` takes an argument
 in exactly the shape `append <value> to <list>` does — and `append each ...
 to <list>` compiles (BAS2-39) while `write each ... to <file>` does not.
 See Discrepancy 1.
